{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5,"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.x"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Geo 可视化交互示例（geoplot + GeoPandas）\n","\n","本 notebook 使用 GeoPandas 自带的示例数据（naturalearth_lowres、naturalearth_cities、nybb），展示常见的地理可视化方法：choropleth、polyplot、pointplot、KDE、hexbin，以及如何添加瓦片底图（contextily）。如果你的环境没有安装 geoplot、contextily 或 cartopy，请先运行下面的安装命令。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-01-20T00:00:00.000000Z"}},"source":["# 安装（如需）\n","# !pip install geoplot geopandas contextily cartopy matplotlib"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["import geopandas as gpd\n","import geoplot as gp\n","import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n","import contextily as ctx\n","import numpy as np\n","from shapely.geometry import Point\n","\n","# 保证图像 inline（Jupyter）\n","%matplotlib inline"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 加载示例数据\n","- world: naturalearth_lowres（国家边界）\n","- cities: naturalearth_cities（城市点）\n","- nybb: NYC borough boundaries（用于点示例与 KDE/hexbin）"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["world = gpd.read_file(gpd.datasets.get_path('naturalearth_lowres'))\n","cities = gpd.read_file(gpd.datasets.get_path('naturalearth_cities'))\n","# nybb 的原始 CRS 可能是美制投影，转到 WGS84（经纬度）以便演示\n","nybb = gpd.read_file(gpd.datasets.get_path('nybb')).to_crs(epsg=4326)\n","\n","world.head()"]","outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 1) Choropleth：人口密度（示例）\n","我们将计算每个国家的人口密度并用 choropleth 展示。为保证面积计算合理，先投影到 Web Mercator（EPSG:3857），计算面积（平方米），再回到经纬度用于绘图（PlateCarree 投影）。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["# 复制 world 并投影以计算面积（m^2）\n","world_area = world.to_crs(epsg=3857).copy()\n","world_area['area_km2'] = world_area['geometry'].area / 1e6  # 转为 km^2\n","# 使用 population estimate（pop_est）作为示例\n","world_area['pop_density_km2'] = world_area['pop_est'] / world_area['area_km2']\n","# 把结果并回传到经纬度（用于简单绘图）\n","world_plot = world_area.to_crs(epsg=4326)\n","\n","fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(12, 6), subplot_kw={'projection': None})\n","# geoplot.choropleth 会自动处理 GeoDataFrame（非 cartopy 投影时直接用 GeoPandas 绘图样式）\n","gp.choropleth(world_plot, hue='pop_density_km2', cmap='OrRd', ax=ax, linewidth=0.3, edgecolor='gray', legend=True)\n","ax.set_title('世界人口密度（按 km²） — 示例')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 2) Polygon / Polyplot：NYC Borough 边界示例\n","演示如何绘制多边形边界并叠加标签。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(8, 8))\n","gp.polyplot(nybb, ax=ax, facecolor='none', edgecolor='black', linewidth=1)\n","ax.set_title('NYC Borough Boundaries (nybb)')\n","# 在多边形中心添加标签\n","for idx, row in nybb.iterrows():\n","    centroid = row.geometry.centroid\n","    ax.text(centroid.x, centroid.y, row.BoroName, horizontalalignment='center')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 3) Pointplot：自然地理城市点（naturalearth_cities）\n","将城市点绘制在世界地图上，展示如何通过颜色或大小编码属性（此数据集没有丰富属性，演示基本用法）。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(12, 6))\n","world_plot.boundary.plot(ax=ax, linewidth=0.5, color='gray')\n","gp.pointplot(cities, ax=ax, color='blue', markersize=20)\n","ax.set_title('Natural Earth Cities (示例点图)')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 4) KDE（核密度估计）：基于随机生成的 NYC 点样本\n","此处为了演示，我们在 nybb 的总边界内随机生成 1000 个点，并用 KDE 可视化 hotspots。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["# 随机生成点（在 nybb 总 bounds 内）\n","minx, miny, maxx, maxy = nybb.total_bounds\n","n = 1000\n","xs = np.random.uniform(minx, maxx, n)\n","ys = np.random.uniform(miny, maxy, n)\n","points = gpd.GeoDataFrame(geometry=[Point(x, y) for x, y in zip(xs, ys)], crs='EPSG:4326')\n","# 裁切到多个 borough 的多边形内（保留落在任何 borough 内的点）\n","mask = points.within(nybb.unary_union)\n","points = points[mask].reset_index(drop=True)\n","\n","fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(8, 8))\n","# 使用 geoplot.kdeplot（注意：需要 scipy）\n","gp.kdeplot(points, clip=nybb.unary_union, cmap='Reds', shade=True, bw_adjust=0.5, ax=ax)\n","gp.polyplot(nybb, ax=ax, facecolor='none', edgecolor='black')\n","ax.set_title('NYC 随机点的 KDE 热点图（示例）')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 5) Hexbin：在 Web Mercator 投影下对点进行六边形分箱，可添加瓦片底图\n","我们把点投影为 EPSG:3857，然后用 matplotlib 的 hexbin 绘制，并用 contextily 加底图。"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["# 将点投影到 Web Mercator，以便与瓦片底图对齐\n","points_3857 = points.to_crs(epsg=3857)\n","nybb_3857 = nybb.to_crs(epsg=3857)\n","xs = points_3857.geometry.x\n","ys = points_3857.geometry.y\n","\n","fig, ax = plt.subplots(1, 1, figsize=(10, 10))\n","hb = ax.hexbin(xs, ys, gridsize=60, cmap='YlOrRd', mincnt=1)\n","nybb_3857.boundary.plot(ax=ax, edgecolor='black', linewidth=1)\n","# 添加瓦片底图（contextily）\n","ctx.add_basemap(ax, source=ctx.providers.Stamen.TonerLite)\n","cbar = fig.colorbar(hb, ax=ax, fraction=0.03, pad=0.04)\n","ax.set_axis_off()\n","ax.set_title('NYC Hexbin (Web Mercator) with Basemap')\n","plt.show()"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## 保存输出示例\n","你可以把图保存为 PNG 或 SVG："]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{},"source":["# 作为示例，保存上一个 figure（如果在 notebook 中重运行，请确保 fig 指向当前图）\n","fig.savefig('examples/output/nyc_hexbin.png', dpi=300, bbox_inches='tight')\n","print('Saved: examples/output/nyc_hexbin.png')"],"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["---\n","更多扩展示例：\n","- 使用真实 POI 或事故数据替换随机点，观察 KDE/hexbin 的差异；\n","- 使用 geoplot 和 cartopy 的投影参数绘制更复杂的带投影地图（如极区投影）；\n","- 将 notebook 转为脚本或为每个示例加入参数化函数以供批量生成地图。"]}]}